    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogue",
      "key": "spouseRoom_Harvey",
      "field": null,
      "source": "#$c .5#No air-traffic this morning, honey. But it's still fun to break out the equipment now and then.#$e#I'm working on a new model plane. It's so much more relaxing here than in my old apartment.",
      "translation": "#$c .5#Dnes ráno žádný letecký provoz, zlato. Přesto je zábavné čas od času vytáhnout vybavení.#$e#Pracuji na novém modelu letadla. Tady je to mnohem pohodovější než v mém starém bytě.",
      "sourceSHA256": "06d53e8d31fec0a37d159588834847141a16b03b519aedf787b2b6d7121e1be6",
      "translationSHA256": "e6028526baf5042f74aefccc8dd925573870491cfa6c4ff6af895a83a8a75093",
