    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogue",
      "key": "spouseRoom_Shane",
      "field": null,
      "source": "#$c .5#Beer or cider? Sometimes life can be challenging.#$e#Hi, @. I'll just hang out in here today and uh... maybe sweep the floor a little bit or something.",
      "translation": "#$c .5#Pivo, nebo cider? Život někdy přináší těžká rozhodnutí.#$e#Ahoj, @. Dnes budu jen tady a ehm... možná trochu zametu podlahu nebo něco takového.",
      "sourceSHA256": "2cc1fa000137baaa2b84a0e858f2c100a9fd2aebde1f2b53506c6edac35107ce",
      "translationSHA256": "02965a143c2468d95dc177f28beec7917f95a6795380537db444e51e8ae85576",
