    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogue",
      "key": "Outdoor_Krobus",
      "field": null,
      "source": "On a day like this, I can enjoy the outdoors with you. This is really nice!$h#$b#Just let me know if you see anyone coming, so I can hide.$u",
      "translation": "V takový den si s tebou mohu užívat pobyt venku. Je to opravdu příjemné!$h#$b#Jen mi dej vědět, kdyby se někdo blížil, abych se mohl schovat.$u",
      "sourceSHA256": "94feeb2e233be7fa3196e2cbcaa301a4db4af32504cb3ee1c9ec4256a408047e",
      "translationSHA256": "ac3431eb51a5aee2cd5001569c2f372393b8fb0128823d295d4c14c357f7395e",
      "reviewChecks": [
